d38c53f4244dabebf0202.webp?t=1603360091\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br><br>Take control of the Pug Otis, the loyal companion of the Professor! After an accident in the Professor\u2019s lab involving the mischievous cat Whiskers and some Portal Fluids, Otis and Whiskers are sucked into an alternate dimension.<br><br>Hop, dimension swap and navigate your way through four unique dimensions to chase down Whiskers and save him from his evil wrongdoings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/940590/extras/c69c573fa6927f0491badca1141133c8.webp?t=1603360091\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dimension-Swapping Action Pug Platforming!<br></li><li>32 levels spread across 4 alternate dimensions<br></li><li>40 unique hats to unlock - Cowboy hat, welders mask, even a brain slug!<br></li><li>Become a pugillionaire by collecting gold coins to spend in the hat shop<br></li><li>Find the special purple coins hidden in each level to buy the rarest hats<br></li><li>Activate powerups to shrink, launch, bounce and accelerate the Pug through the level<br></li><li>Earn a purrfect score by running a level without failing once!<br></li><li>Includes challenging bonus dimension <i>Whiskers of Wrath</i> for the ultimate test of skill</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4f602da2683f73169c4ca1422dec25bbd50ffd3c.jpg","localized_name":"Pampered pug","name":"Pampered pug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/940590/4f602da2683f73169c4ca1422dec25bbd50ffd3c.jpg"},{"icon":"f1d62abc218a644e75ec6c2640ece669092aadd6.jpg","localized_name":"Does that sting?","name":"Does that sting?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/940590/f1d62abc218a644e75ec6c2640ece669092aadd6.jpg"},{"icon":"77ba2052db4a173b8c21bd521c00446c4e676182.jpg","localized_name":"I think he wants to communicate!","name":"I think he 